 Screenshot 4.png", "id": "873992396602223", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974864_873992399935556_1633622422788963725_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YXaF0eFbV04Q7kNvwHiv4M8&_nc_oc=AdoEYxYrWstbw0avnevFWFb7FjKmJzANFN8ZMNsVgpri3cdXl51Spe1az3eJEtG2vHo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4LV7YBZkhm9EzItFM1vcz-x9TOCzGlUx9955dbMHuStA&oe=69FA107E"}, {"file_name": "EEC Screenshot 5.png", "id": "5395686713791034", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974748_5395686717124367_6902466276144487558_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mo2fQrAlGwYQ7kNvwGwpWDQ&_nc_oc=AdrGEp8_e3A_doF4Ta0hKcsV7_EXAnPnBoIE0iC_BF16AW9uWBZsUomxU_mgQbRoOPY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4dsrIRHwWHZlJXwt0aYX3CBo8q7w2nZCvewf7LdF2kQQ&oe=69FA0EC6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ellic's Exercise Class", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is a VR exergame called \u201cEllic\u2019s Exercise Class\u201d. Ellic will guide you through the play. The game includes seven mini exercise games: blocking, goalkeeper, volleyball, archery, skeet, baseball, and shooter. You will interact with virtual objects by moving your body and arms and triggering sporting events with the handheld controllers. Join Ellic's Exercise Class today! Each mini-game has three difficulty levels, and there must be a level right for you!", "short_description": "This is a VR exergame called \u201cEllic\u2019s Exercise Class\u201d. Ellic will guide you through the play. The game includes seven mini exercise games: blocking, goalkeeper, volleyball, archery, skeet, baseball, and shooter. You will interact with virtual objects by moving your body and arms and triggering sporting events with the handheld controllers. Join Ellic's Exercise Class today! Each mini-game has three difficulty levels, and there must be a level right for you!"}]}, "developer_